# Code owners are requested automatically as reviewers for matching paths.
# The last matching pattern wins.
#
# @OWNER_OR_TEAM is a placeholder. Bootstrap replaces it with a user or team
# that has write access to this repository; repository validation reports it
# while it remains. An unreplaced placeholder shows as an error on GitHub.
#
# CODEOWNERS alone does not enforce reviews. Mandatory code owner review needs
# a branch ruleset. For a solo account, do not require code owner approval:
# authors cannot approve their own pull requests, so every merge would block.

*                   @OWNER_OR_TEAM

# Changes here need elevated review attention.
/.github/           @OWNER_OR_TEAM
/.project/          @OWNER_OR_TEAM
/SECURITY.md        @OWNER_OR_TEAM
/docs/architecture/ @OWNER_OR_TEAM
